unordered_dense.h and stl.h are the unmodified headers from
ankerl::unordered_dense v5.3.2, commit
ddd49116e63be7345b448351cad153653a712fdb:
https://github.com/martinus/unordered_dense/tree/v5.3.2

Its MIT notice is retained in the header and distributed as
java.base's legal/unordered_dense.md. oops/symbolIndexMap.inline.hpp provides
the HotSpot standard-library boundary and mtSymbol allocator.
